      "title": "Quantization: INT8 and INT4",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Quantization: INT8 and INT4",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What It Buys",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Store weights (optionally activations or KV cache) in ==fewer bits==",
                "FP16 → ==INT8== is **2×** smaller; ==INT4== is **4×** smaller",
                "Decode is memory-bound, so fewer bytes per weight gives ==faster tokens==",
                "Smaller weights fit a **bigger model** on one GPU"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Which Scheme",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Scheme",
                "Quantizes",
                "Speeds up"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "{purple:INT4 weight-only} (GPTQ, AWQ)",
                  "weights",
                  "decode; **common serving choice**"
                ],
                [
                  "{blue:INT8 W+A} (SmoothQuant)",
                  "weights + activations",
                  "decode and compute-bound ==prefill=="
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Quality and Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Lossy: INT8 is usually ==near-lossless==",
                "INT4 shows ==small quality drops==",
                "{red:Outliers} and **small models** suffer most"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Quantize",
                    "sub": "INT8 / INT4",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Task accuracy",
                    "sub": "vs FP16",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Perplexity",
                    "sub": "vs FP16",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Ship",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Never skip evaluation",
              "text": "Always compare ==task accuracy== and ==perplexity== against the **FP16 baseline** after quantizing."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
