          "title": "Speculative Decoding and Latency vs Throughput",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Speculative Decoding",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "chain",
              "spec": {
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "text": "Draft model",
                    "note": "small, proposes k tokens",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Target model",
                    "note": "verifies all k in one pass",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Keep prefix",
                    "note": "accepted tokens stay",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Resample",
                    "note": "first rejected, from target",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "{green:Lossless}: the output distribution equals the target model's",
                "Rejected tokens are ==resampled from the target==, so quality is unchanged",
                "Speedup depends on the ==acceptance rate=="
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. When It Pays Off",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Situation",
                "Gain"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Good draft, low temperature",
                  "{green:Large}"
                ],
                [
                  "Poor draft model",
                  "{red:Little or negative}"
                ],
                [
                  "High-temperature sampling",
                  "{red:Little or negative}"
                ],
                [
                  "Low batch, latency-sensitive",
                  "{green:Best fit}"
                ],
                [
                  "Large batch, GPU already busy",
                  "Shrinks"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Latency vs Throughput",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Bigger batch: ==more tokens/s overall==",
                "But each user waits longer: higher **TTFT** and **TPOT**",
                "Pick the batch size from the ==SLO== (TTFT and TPOT targets)"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Speculative decoding cuts **latency** at low batch. Batching raises **throughput** at the cost of latency."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
